            "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
            "body": "@justinmk this one is a draft anyway and not ready for review quite yet, although you can at least see how I've been trying to tackle it. I don't really know best practices on the C side or what makes a good structure. Was trying to keep it simple and leave room for expansion via `img_data`, `img_set`, and `img_del` with `opts` to provide ways to grow these. Mostly thinking of chunked image data.\r\n\r\nAlso, I've been fairly slow getting back to #39496, so no worries there. If you have time to review, I'm on vacation through the 21st and will have my laptop, so I can address more comments, although I'd say as soon as we can get that PR merged in then I'll be able to tackle this space and (potentially) things in connection to https://github.com/neovim/neovim/issues/32189 and https://github.com/neovim/neovim/issues/24164",
